# Xcode
#
# gitignore contributors: remember to update Global/Xcode.gitignore, Objective-C.gitignore & Swift.gitignore

# 注意：BiliDown.xcodeproj 和 Sources/*/Info.plist 是**入库**的。
# 它们虽然由 `xcodegen generate` 从 project.yml 生成，但入库是有意的：
# 别人 clone 下来直接双击就能编译，不用先装 XcodeGen。
# 改了 project.yml 之后记得跑一次 xcodegen，把这两样一起提交上去，别让它们对不上。

## User settings
xcuserdata/

## Obj-C/Swift specific
*.hmap

## App packaging
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

## 构建产物
#
# 平时都编在仓库外面（-derivedDataPath /tmp/…），手滑在仓库里编一次就会冒出来
build/
build-release/
DerivedData/
# 解开的 .ipa 目录树：`unzip BiliDown.ipa` 出来的就是它
Payload/

## 本机的工程状态，Xcode 一打开就改
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout

## Playgrounds
timeline.xctimeline
playground.xcworkspace

# Swift Package Manager
#
# 只忽略构建时写出来的那份锁文件（在
# `BiliDown.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/` 里）。
# 它入库也没用：SwiftLAME 的版本本来就钉在 project.yml 的 revision 上，
# 这份锁文件说不出比那更多的东西，只会每次构建都把工作区弄脏。
#
# 下面几行是模板里「把依赖源码整个入库」那套路子，这个项目不走，保留原样。
# Packages/
# Package.pins
# *.xcodeproj
Package.resolved
.swiftpm/

.build/

# CocoaPods
#
# We recommend against adding the Pods directory to your .gitignore. However
# you should judge for yourself, the pros and cons are mentioned at:
# https://guides.cocoapods.org/using/using-cocoapods.html#should-i-check-the-pods-directory-into-source-control
#
# Pods/
#
# Add this line if you want to avoid checking in source code from the Xcode workspace
# *.xcworkspace

# Carthage
#
# Add this line if you want to avoid checking in source code from Carthage dependencies.
# Carthage/Checkouts

Carthage/Build/

# fastlane
#
# It is recommended to not store the screenshots in the git repo.
# Instead, use fastlane to re-generate the screenshots whenever they are needed.
# For more information about the recommended setup visit:
# https://docs.fastlane.tools/best-practices/source-control/#source-control

fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/Preview.html
fastlane/screenshots/**/*.png
fastlane/test_output

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Claude Code 的本地权限白名单：记的是这台机器上放行过哪些命令，
# 属于本机状态，不是项目的一部分。
.claude/settings.local.json

# 本机的签名 / DEVELOPMENT_TEAM 覆盖，别提交
*.local.xcconfig